"context_after":"争衡河洛间者，可勿加之意哉？","context_before":"...者必出之地也。《地志》：华州内扼秦雍之口，外拊河洛之背。","source_end_index":88,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"303ee119-851d-5545-9ed2-4e342b710815","source_start_index":66,"source_text":"战国秦惠王六年，魏纳阴晋，而三晋之亡自此始。"}],"path":"陕西方舆纪要/二、西安府下（卷五十四）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":[],"content":"2魏以陰晉爲和於秦，實華陰。","content_fanyi":"魏国把阴晋割让给秦国以求和，阴晋其实就是华阴。","content_jianti_auto":"2魏以阴晋为和于秦，实华阴。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":198,"number":2,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第二 (周紀二) / 顯王 / 三十七年 / 第 2 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"8c407aeb-db0e-11ef-9e5c-a0d3651f611f","year_int":-332},"tongjian_id":"8c407aeb-db0e-11ef-9e5c-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":1}],"page_size":10,"total_pages":1,"total_paragraphs":1},"place_name":"陰晉"},"message":"success","success":true}